This repository ships wrapper scripts, desktop launchers, and a small
miraclecast patch. It does **not** vendor the miraclecast tree.

miraclecast (https://github.com/albfan/miraclecast) remains upstream.
The file patches/miraclecast-samsung-invitation.patch is a derivative of
miraclecast source and is distributed under the same license as upstream
miraclecast (LGPL-2.1+). Apply it to a local clone; do not treat this
repository as a fork of miraclecast.

Scripts, desktop files, and documentation in this repository are MIT
(see LICENSE).
